        </svg>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'relative', zIndex: 1, width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '0 88px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#BFD3EE', letterSpacing: 3, marginBottom: 12 }}>CLOSING · 恳请老师指导</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.25, marginBottom: 8 }}>
            我们需要老师支持的四件事
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ width: 120, height: 4, background: '#FFC107', marginBottom: 26 }} />

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, marginBottom: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18)', borderRadius: 6, padding: '18px 20px', alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, background: '#FFC107', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', marginRight: 16 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>1</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginBottom: 6 }}>判断节奏</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#D6E2F5', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        Q2「先闭环、后插件」的调整是否可行？是否需要进一步压缩或延后某一项？
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18)', borderRadius: 6, padding: '18px 20px', alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, background: '#FFC107', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', marginRight: 16 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>2</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginBottom: 6 }}>集群权限</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#D6E2F5', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        能否协助申请实验室 GPU 集群的只读监控权限，用于 Q3 真实负载采集与验证？
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, marginBottom: 28 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18)', borderRadius: 6, padding: '18px 20px', alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, background: '#FFC107', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', marginRight: 16 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>3</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginBottom: 6 }}>文献校准</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#D6E2F5', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        推荐 1–2 篇多目标 DRL 调度的代表性工作，帮助我们校准奖励设计与评测口径。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18)', borderRadius: 6, padding: '18px 20px', alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, background: '#FFC107', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', marginRight: 16 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>4</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginBottom: 6 }}>算力与渠道</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#D6E2F5', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        是否有可参与的算力或云资源渠道，用以降低 Q3 真实集群验证的成本？
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
